# panel fixture: the matrix shows on, skipped and event steps
# (The file name still says chord. A chord step's LED in Page view is Q37, pending/a_chord_step_or_hyperstep_in_page_view; renaming the file would be a deletion for the ratchet.)
# manual: p014, p034
# workflow: Page mode step LEDs
given step 0 1 on
given step 1 2 skip
given step 4 5 on
given step 4 5 event
given step 5 6 on
given step 5 6 skip
expect led step(0,1) = green steady
expect led step(1,2) = red steady
expect led step(4,5) = orange steady
expect led step(5,6) = red steady
expect led step(9,16) = off
